<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#SS20" title="In D. Mixed Hodge modules ‣ An overview of Morihiko Saito’s theoryof mixed Hodge modules" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">20 </span>Definition of mixed Hodge modules</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#SS21" title="In D. Mixed Hodge modules ‣ An overview of Morihiko Saito’s theoryof mixed Hodge modules" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">21 </span>Properties of mixed Hodge modules</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#SS22" title="In D. Mixed Hodge modules ‣ An overview of Morihiko Saito’s theoryof mixed Hodge modules" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">22 </span>Algebraic mixed Hodge modules</span></a></li>
